WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:05.376
Alpha and beta decay change the element. Gamma only carries energy away.

2
00:00:06.102 --> 00:00:10.902
Uranium two thirty eight is unstable: its nucleus will decay.

3
00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:18.597
Alpha: two protons and two neutrons leave. Now it is thorium.

4
00:00:21.516 --> 00:00:25.741
Beta: a neutron becomes a proton, and an electron leaves.

5
00:00:28.733 --> 00:00:32.858
Gamma: only energy leaves. Same element, same mass.
